{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "䟽云即攝論說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "䟽云十卷入楞\n伽經第七卷入道品說及十地經說也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "䟽云十地菩薩有起煩𢙉謂悲增上者有不起煩𢙉謂智增上者又解或雖悲智平等而所樂行不同一怖故伏恐為過失二不怖故起\n為利生故或伏不伏有此差別"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此花座更有微塵數諸小花座為眷属故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "眾相具足故也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此座㝡勝名第一義又此座堪與菩薩座中證第一義諦故名第一義相"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "類等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "晉言具足"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云淨飯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即賢刼等經也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上俱舍義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "倍四十嵗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "倍八十嵗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "倍一百六\n\n十嵗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "倍三百二十嵗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "倍六百四十嵗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "倍二\n千五百嵗此行難行故起壽行"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "倍五千嵗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "倍一万嵗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "倍二万嵗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "倍四万嵗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "倍八万嵗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "勝觀即毗婆尸佛也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "部迷反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云執日"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五計反羿善射也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "孚袁反米汁也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "堂練反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鄭日孔子與人言必待其人心憤憤口悱悱乃後發啟也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "初委反度也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "隨舉經後皆舉前叚釋經䟽文亦得"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "言八事者利𮕱毀譽稱譏苦樂得財名利失財名𮕱但談𢙣名毀談\n善名譽對面談善名稱談𢙣名譏苦樂二事以受為體也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T25n1509_p0340c16"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T04n0202_p0436a16"}
